{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029080/extras/b39ded48b1a3acc1bc45bec9621cc50f.avif?t=1758915614\" width=482 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is under threat from an advancing horde of undead, so the Adventurer's Guild has been especially busy in recent days, with numerous jobs available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a beginner summoner, you've accepted a very peculiar job: Protect an old sacred tree. <br>You thought it was an odd job at first, but then you learnt it's not just any normal tree...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This special tree, separated from the forest nearby, is home to Olivea... A captivating Dryad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Olivea is a mature dryad, she requested for your help, and she's ready to reward you for all of your efforts...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029080/extras/41028448d43a563d03a8e849c56e803b.avif?t=1758915614\" width=482 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entwined Roots is a blend of Visual Novel storytelling and simple yet engaging tower defense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level you conquer, unlock new story segments and steamy hand-drawn scenes that bring you closer to Olivea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can replay your favourite scenes at any time through the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029080/extras/302f1c36c91fd2545284658ba3150641.avif?t=1758915614\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029080?t=1758915614","backgro